    "review.paige-ai.small.private.practice.pathology.groups": "小型私人诊疗病理学团队",
    "review.paige-ai.laboratories.without.digital.pathology.scanners": "没有数字病理学扫描仪的实验室",
    "review.paige-ai.settings.requiring.analysis.of.rare": "需要分析罕见或不支持的肿瘤类型的环境",
